Kompas studio photo v1. Editorial visual review approved.
Original SHA-256: 3b40feddcd1177d54ee9758f97b4c31b1e62322ca3aae19e688641ebd915f201
Simple day-planning desk with an open window instead of an elaborate bedtime scene, one plain switch-off routine shown via a work bag set to the side and calendar blocks left blank. Make one original ultra-realistic live editorial studio photograph for the independent magazine Kompas. Wide landscape about 1.9:1, central subject inside the middle 75% for a consistent crop; clear plausible optics and readable shadow detail. Real controlled directional daylight, neutral-warm color, tactile ordinary materials, one purposeful subject and an interesting but restrained sense of depth. Photographic, no layout or decorative graphics. No people, faces, hands, silhouettes, visible lettering, numbers, logos, neon, fake interface or watermarks.
